{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":485255,"name":"","username":"Dominik-N","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/dominik-n/{size}/120138_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T12:04:00.835Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey there,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eit’s kind of a simply question because I can not find any Quota Usage for both plans.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI just wanna use “Grok Bot”. So I’m struggling to decide if “Cursor Individual Ultra” is better then “SuperGrok Heavy” Vice versa.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBoth plans just saying “Highest Usage of Grok Bot” but does one plan having more usage then the other?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhat are the other Benefits?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKind of confusing for me. Hopefully someone can help me out with that.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheers\u003cbr\u003e\nDominik\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T13:05:20.466Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":23,"reads":13,"readers_count":12,"score":132.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170888,"topic_slug":"supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136611,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra/170888/1","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":485533,"name":"Danny","username":"DannyB","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/dannyb/{size}/119004_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-07T15:56:53.961Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eAs far as I know, the Grok Bot weekly usage is identical on Super Grok Heavy vs Cursor Ultra. I had the EXACT same decision to make as you a couple of weeks ago; I chose Cursor Ultra, since it’s 2/3 of the price… but I’m also interested to hear the answer!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor me I JUST wanted access to Grok Bot. I believe that the only extra benefit of Super Grok is the Imagine video generation etc, but I could be wrong!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-07T15:58:51.749Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":7.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170888,"topic_slug":"supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra","display_username":"Danny","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":134868,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra/170888/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":485852,"name":"server","username":"server","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/server/{size}/115992_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T02:28:39.469Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eOne thing worth factoring into the Heavy vs Ultra choice: Heavy no longer includes free Cursor Ultra for new links. Official docs now treat linking as a usage grant (Grok Bot), not a Cursor Ultra plan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOn Aug 15, staff (deanrie) in Free Cursor Ultra with Grok (posts \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#6\u003c/span\u003e and \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#9\u003c/span\u003e) said the banner was correct — Ultra stays while Heavy stays active. Mid/late Aug that promo copy disappeared from the help docs with no dated public cutoff I’ve found. Colin later said the promo ended and existing claimants keep Ultra; new links get Grok Bot only.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBilling has also said they don’t have a published cutoff date and the help page was behind. Public timeline thread: \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/did-i-miss-an-announcement-on-supergrok-heavy-and-cursor-ultra/169128\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eDid I miss an announcement on SuperGrok Heavy and Cursor Ultra?\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo if you only want Grok Bot, Ultra may be the cleaner buy. If you’re looking at Heavy expecting Ultra at $0, that’s the older offer — did anyone here see an official dated end announcement before the docs changed?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T02:28:39.469Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":9,"reads":10,"readers_count":9,"score":47.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170888,"topic_slug":"supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra","display_username":"server","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/did-i-miss-an-announcement-on-supergrok-heavy-and-cursor-ultra/169128","internal":true,"reflection":false,"title":"Did I miss an announcement on SuperGrok Heavy and Cursor Ultra?","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":130570,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra/170888/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":487861,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T05:11:37.543Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey Dominik, good request. A lot of users get tripped up here.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor Grok Bot, Cursor Ultra and SuperGrok Heavy are on the same top tier. Both give the highest weekly Grok Bot quota, and neither gives more than the other. There is also no difference in models, speed, or priority. Grok Bot works the same on both. If an account somehow has both, the quotas do not stack. You just keep the highest one.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe real difference is what else each plan includes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCursor Ultra is a Cursor subscription. Besides Grok Bot, it includes Ultra-level usage for Cursor itself editor, Agent, Cloud Agents, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperGrok Heavy is an xAI subscription. Besides the Grok Bot usage grant, it includes SuperGrok Heavy features on \u003ca href=\"http://grok.com\"\u003egrok.com\u003c/a\u003e and in the Grok apps. It does not include a Cursor plan. Linking SuperGrok gives your Cursor account the Grok Bot quota, but it does not change your Cursor plan. The earlier offer free Cursor Ultra with Heavy ended at the end of August and is no longer available.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSo if you only need Grok Bot, pick based on which extra features you will actually use. If you also plan to code in Cursor, Ultra gives you everything in one place. If you want Grok’s own features, go with Heavy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith either plan, once the weekly quota is used up, you can keep going via on-demand usage if you enable it on \u003ca href=\"http://cursor.com\"\u003ecursor.com\u003c/a\u003e with a saved payment method.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCurrent details:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/plans\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003ePlans and billing | Cursor Docs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/supergrok\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eLink SuperGrok for Grok Bot | Cursor Docs\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-10T05:11:37.543Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170888,"topic_slug":"supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://grok.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Grok","clicks":0},{"url":"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/plans","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Plans and billing | Cursor Docs","clicks":0},{"url":"https://cursor.com/help/grok-bot/supergrok","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Link SuperGrok for Grok Bot | Cursor Docs","clicks":0},{"url":"http://cursor.com","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"AI Coding Agent for Building Ambitious Software | Cursor","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra/170888/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[485255,485533,485852,487861]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,4],[2,3],[4,1]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"fancy_title":"SuperGrok Heavy vs Cursor Individual Ultra","id":170888,"title":"SuperGrok Heavy vs Cursor Individual Ultra","posts_count":4,"created_at":"2026-09-07T12:04:00.787Z","views":120,"reply_count":0,"like_count":1,"last_posted_at":"2026-09-10T05:11:37.543Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"supergrok-heavy-vs-cursor-individual-ultra","category_id":8,"word_count":607,"deleted_at":null,"user_id":136611,"featured_link":null,"pinned_globally":false,"pinned_at":null,"pinned_until":null,"image_url":null,"slow_mode_seconds":0,"draft":null,"draft_key":"topic_170888","draft_sequence":null,"unpinned":null,"pinned":false,"current_post_number":1,"highest_post_number":8,"deleted_by":null,"actions_summary":[{"id":4,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":8,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":10,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false},{"id":7,"count":0,"hidden":false,"can_act":false}],"chunk_size":20,"bookmarked":false,"topic_ti